# TCLS: a slow FM6 release must still end. The fuzzer (seed 27) played the GLASS BELL factory patch
# (F2, the CHORDS sound card's SLOT) and released the note; the release rings out for several seconds,
# which a fixed 3 s tail flagged as a hung voice. The engine's own test allows up to ~24 s, so this
# asserts the voice ends within a generous bound and that no note is left held.
wait 300
cursor 3 0
tap EDIT
tap EDIT
expect view 12
turn K4 1 90
expect sound3.0.7 1
key 4 down
key 4 up
wait 12000
expect fm6voices 0
expect fm6held 0
expect heldnotes 0
